00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:48.570
Give up and go home and sleep already.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.880
Mom...!

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:16.850
What was that all of a sudden?
That scared me.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.810
Are you all right, Akemi?

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:22.650
Wow...

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.110
Ronaldo the Great, thank you so much!

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:27.320
As expected of a hunter!

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:30.070
Huh? Momo?
What are you doing here?

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:32.700
Huh? Huh? Uh...

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:36.870
Momo, did you want to meet Ronaldo
the Great, too? Sorry I hogged him...

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:37.710
Huh?

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:39.580
Was that what it was?

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.880
Jealous of your mom?

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.290
So cute!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:47.340
My son's a fan, too!
Will you shake his hand?

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:51.680
H-Hello...

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:07.110
No...!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:18.460
"And Then Comes Father"

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:25.460
Hey, Ronaldo! It's so boring!

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.800
Wanna play <i>Vario Kart</i>?

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:34.470
Where are you going? Sandbucks?

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:36.680
I wanna go, too.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:38.890
I even practiced a spell to
get ready to go to Sandies--

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.640
Venti mocha, add shots of hazelnut,
vanilla, almond, and caramel

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:44.480
with extra whip and caramel sauce.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:47.030
Can you take care of that idiot
for me for a while?

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:53.450
Now I can concentrate on my writing.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:54.660
Huh?

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.330
Welcome back.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:03.750
Bastard, how did you get back here--?

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:06.290
Huh? He didn't die.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:09.960
Do you not know how to treat guests, Paul?

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.720
Huh? You're Draluc's old man!

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:16.430
Long time no see, Paul--
I mean, Hunter Ronaldo!

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:17.350
Go home!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.600
Will you let me talk to you
for just a little longer?

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:21.980
What do you want, barging in like this?!

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:24.850
I came to see my son, of course.

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:29.440
What? Are you saying I'm wrong for
coming all this way to visit my son?

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:32.490
You <i>are </i>wrong if you come in without
permission and make yourself tea!

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:34.990
Well, where is Draluc?

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:37.990
Oh, he went out. You just missed him!

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:41.870
Um... he's out volunteering to help
with the emotional education of kids.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:44.750
I-I expect no less from my son!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:47.000
That's too bad, though.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.550
I brought so many presents for him, too.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:53.510
If you're spoiled for 200 years,
you'll turn out like Draluc...

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:56.680
I have a present for you, too, John.
It's the turntable you wanted.

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:58.010
An unexpected hobby!

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:01.640
Here's something for you, too, Paul.
It's from the 100-yen shop.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:04.440
Go home, damn it!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.900
I have no choice.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:07.980
I'll wait here until Draluc gets back!

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:09.400
Did you hear anything I said?!

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:13.400
♬ Cruel hunter! I won't move
one step until I see my son! ♬

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:14.780
Don't dance!

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:17.530
Damn it... Oh, well, I'll just
ignore him. Ignore him!

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:20.080
Pretend he's not there and concentrate...

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:26.210
What, is that the next
<i>Ronaldo Chronicles </i>book?

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:28.750
Bear it! You lose if you react!

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:31.840
Let's see... "And then
I threw a ball at him"--

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:33.470
Don't read it!

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:35.050
About <i>The Ronaldo Chronicles</i>--

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:39.050
I must say, you haven't done nearly
enough research about vampires.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:41.390
Especially how you depict Draluc!

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:43.480
You should write more
details about my son.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:45.100
I want to punch him so hard...

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:48.520
I brought this because
I thought it could help you.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.570
Draluc's photo album,
with pictures by Daddy!

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:52.030
Take that home!

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:55.030
Why do you have a photo album?!
You guys don't show up in pictures, right?

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:58.160
We do if we try hard with a nice camera.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:01.280
My son was so cute when he was young...

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:04.330
Because he was weak, I worried a lot,

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:10.340
but 200 years ago, we were much more
at odds with humans than we are now.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:14.460
I swore that I would protect
that frail child until the end.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.930
"Draluc's Birthday"

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.930
Well, cameras weren't
invented yet 200 years ago,

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.510
"Draluc's Birthday"

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.510
so I don't haven't any pictures
of him from back then, though!

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:22.180
"Draluc's Birthday"

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:22.180
Then don't show these to me!

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:25.100
Also, here's my autobiography!
Please use it as a reference.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:29.100
If you insist, I can also
make an appearan--

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:30.270
Ow...

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:31.940
It messes up my rhythm when you don't die.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:34.730
You didn't have to say it
like that, you stripling!

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:38.990
Anyway, what, are you saying that
you often cause Draluc to die?!

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:41.490
Shut up! He dies on his own all the time!

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:45.040
He's harder to keep alive
than a festival goldfish!

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:49.370
John, are you all right?
Is that bastard doing mean things to you?

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.420
What the hell? I would never
do anything like that to John!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.050
J-John...!

00:18:57.050 --> 00:19:00.180
John's eyes look sad... What did you do?!

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:03.760
Shut up! That was--
I'm really sorry about that!

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:07.270
I won't allow it anymore! I can't let
Draluc stay with the likes of you!

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:08.480
I'm taking him home!

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:14.020
Yeah, take him! It'll be a relief
to be rid of that pain in the ass...

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:17.320
Your teamwork with that
vampire was well-received.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:19.780
Let's make it a focal point for
<i>The Ronaldo Chronicles </i>from now on.

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.740
I'm looking forward to it.

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:25.080
Wait, we should ask Draluc
about what he wants to do first.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:27.580
Huh? Oh, right...

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:31.710
But Draluc hasn't come home yet
and isn't answering his phone.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.710
Could he have been kidnapped?!

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.050
Let him leave the nest already, old man!

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:37.510
Quiet! Anything could happen
to a child so cute--

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:40.380
Excuse me.

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:42.760
Sorry, we're not open today...

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:46.600
Hello! Wanna trade adult DVDs?

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:51.850
Look, Draluc's back.

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:54.610
Father. I love this town.

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.270
You can't trick me with that!

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:58.940
Stop messing around!
I'm going to look for Draluc!

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:01.740
Hey, wait up! Fine, I'll go, too!

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:03.780
Not here...

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:08.160
I guess we'll have to search the
places where that idiot might go.

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:11.120
Draluc? I haven't seen him today.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:13.750
Tell him I want him to make
me pudding next time!

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:17.460
Draluc? I haven't seen him...
Maybe he's at the guild?

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:20.130
Huh? His dad? Oh, hello...

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:22.380
He has not been here.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.760
Oh, his hot milk tab is growing.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:28.220
Please tell him to stop calling me
"Mr. Hairy Girl Fetish."

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.020
I-I will.

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:33.600
Draluc? I have not seen him tonight.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.190
Did you get into a fight?

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:39.440
Idiot, Ronaldo! I heard you
were looking for Draluc!

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:41.490
Hey, wait! Don't ignore me!

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:43.530
Hey!

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:47.370
Damn it, where did that idiot go?

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:51.370
Draluc, I came to play with you! Draluc!

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:54.000
Are you bored in this
castle all by yourself?

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:58.250
I'm fine. I have John and
my pile of games to play.

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:00.210
You don't have to worry about me.

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:04.680
With just me and John,
it's relaxing, and I don't die.

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:09.180
I've decided not to bring him home.

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:12.980
That child is having fun in this town.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.900
Ronaldo.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:19.190
It appears my son met a good human.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:21.190
Oh, there he is!

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:22.900
We went to your office,
but you weren't there!

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.900
We've been looking for you, Ronaldo!

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:28.660
Oh, sorry. Where's Lord Dral?

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:31.490
He's turned into super shiny mud balls!

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:35.580
Peace, peace! I'm shining like jewels!

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:39.920
Dra--!

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.880
Oh, shut up, damn it!

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:50.310
That reminds me, how's the <i>Ronaldo</i>
<i>Chronicles </i>manuscript going?

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:52.930
I lost motivation thanks to you guys.

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:55.640
John, let me have a turn at the turntable.

00:22:01.690 --> 00:22:02.940
"Mania"

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:05.530
"Mania"
"Fanciful notions"

00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:08.240
We'll settle this before dawn!

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:11.280
John! We'll definitely save you!

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:15.870
The vampire dies in no time.
